        <mxCell id="subtitle" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=#4B5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" value="One site at docs.&amp;lt;domain&amp;gt;, built on Zudoku. Each PortCo builds its section in its own tooling and submits a versioned package; DataX scans every package and publishes approved versions. Readers sign in with their own PortCo work account (multi-tenant Entra app + tenant allow-list). Draft v0.3 · 2026-11-12" vertex="1">
