        <mxCell id="saRules" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2937;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="&lt;b&gt;Write access&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;only the DataX publish identity (Storage Blob Data Contributor). PortCos have no write access.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Read access&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;only the sign-in gate managed identity (Storage Blob Data Reader). No anonymous access.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Hardening&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;public network off · anonymous access off · static website off · shared key off · Defender for Storage · soft delete + versioning" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="690" x="1620" y="558" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
